Rule 3 (The dtypes of the two tensors should be compatible for multiplication)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
>>
Rule 4 (At least one tensor must have elements)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∨ shape(v_2, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (The data type of result should be floating point if one of them is floating point.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8 then dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8
