Rule 6 (Tensors should have compatible number of elements after flattening for vdot)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) -1]: shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) -1]: shape(v_2, i) > 0
>>
Rule 7 (The product of shapes of both tensors should be greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, i) > 0
