Rule 9 (If one of the tensors has boolean dtype, the other must also have a boolean dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 0 then dtype_(v_2) = 0 else if dtype_(v_2) = 0 then dtype_(v_1) = 0
>>
Rule 10 (If one of the tensors has complex dtype, the other must also have a complex dtype)
