>>
Rule 14 (If one of the tensors is empty, the resulting dot product is zero.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0 ∨ ∃j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, j) = 0 then true
